Pinned Calendar launch film: third-party material

Fonts
- Google Sans Flex (variable), by Google. SIL Open Font License 1.1. The same file the app
  ships in app/src/main/res/font/google_sans_flex.ttf.

Tools
- Lemo-Opuscar by Lemomo (LemoLab), https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar
  The render, mux and sound helper code in its core/ folder is used under the MIT License.
  No file of the library is part of the film.

Sound
- The score and every sound effect are synthesized in mix.py. No samples, no recordings.

App footage and screens
- media/shade-pull-640x1428.mp4: an emulator screen recording of the Pinned Calendar app
  (the app's own interface, owned by the project). The calendar entries and to-dos in it,
  and in the cards rebuilt in index.html, are invented sample data.
- assets/icon.png: the Pinned Calendar app icon, owned by the project.
